name 'designing-reliable-apps-postassessment-q1_2025'

question 'A developer wants to display real-time air quality data for a user\'s city using an external service. Which correctly describes the request-response flow?'

wrong 'The developer\'s app downloads the entire air quality database to the user\'s device, then filters it locally'
wrong 'The external service pushes data to the app automatically every few seconds without the app requesting it'
right 'The app sends a request to the API endpoint, the server processes it, and the server sends back the relevant data as a response'
wrong 'The API directly modifies the app\'s HTML file to insert the data onto the page'

allow_multiple_attempts true

